  {%- comment -%} ══════════ TECHNOLOGY ══════════ {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="plstn__section" id="plstn-tech">
    <div class="plstn__wrap">
      <div class="plstn__sec-hd center">
        <span class="plstn__eyebrow">Understand the Technology</span>
        <h2 class="plstn__h2" id="plstn-tech-h">What Separates a $500 Chair from a $9,000 Chair</h2>
        <p>Know the vocabulary before you visit &mdash; you&rsquo;ll feel the difference on the showroom floor.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="plstn__tech-grid">
        <div class="plstn__tech" id="plstn-tech-ltrack">
          <span class="plstn__tech-tag">Full Coverage</span>
          <span class="plstn__tech-ico">&#128260;</span>
          <h3>L-Track vs. S-Track</h3>
          <p>An <strong>L-track</strong> extends the massage rail from the neck all the way through the seat, reaching glutes and hamstrings &mdash; critical for sciatica and hip flexor tension. An S-track only covers the spine curve. All premium chairs here feature L-track.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="plstn__tech" id="plstn-tech-4d">
          <span class="plstn__tech-tag">Advanced Massage</span>
          <span class="plstn__tech-ico">&#129306;</span>
          <h3>4D Massage Arms</h3>
          <p><strong>4D massage arms</strong> move in four planes — up/down, left/right, in/out, and speed variation — creating a sensation that closely mimics skilled human hands. It&rsquo;s the single biggest quality differentiator in premium chairs.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="plstn__tech" id="plstn-tech-zerog">
          <span class="plstn__tech-tag">Spinal Decompression</span>
          <span class="plstn__tech-ico">&#128640;</span>
          <h3>Zero Gravity Position</h3>
          <p><strong>Zero gravity recline</strong> elevates legs above the heart — the neutral position NASA developed for astronauts. This removes gravitational compression from the lumbar spine, letting the rollers work deeper with less pressure.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="plstn__tech" id="plstn-tech-air">
          <span class="plstn__tech-tag">Compression</span>
          <span class="plstn__tech-ico">&#128168;</span>
          <h3>Air Compression Therapy</h3>
          <p><strong>Airbag compression</strong> uses chambers around shoulders, arms, hips, and calves to rhythmically compress and release &mdash; mimicking lymphatic drainage massage. Premium chairs include 40&ndash;80+ individual airbags.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="plstn__tech" id="plstn-tech-heat">
          <span class="plstn__tech-tag">Deep Heat</span>
          <span class="plstn__tech-ico">&#128293;</span>
          <h3>Infrared Heat Therapy</h3>
          <p><strong>Infrared heat</strong> penetrates 2&ndash;3 inches below skin surface, warming muscle tissue from within. Heat elements along the lumbar, calves, and feet dramatically reduce the time needed to release tight muscle groups.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="plstn__tech" id="plstn-tech-scan">
          <span class="plstn__tech-tag">AI Personalization</span>
          <span class="plstn__tech-ico">&#129504;</span>
          <h3>Intelligent Body Scanning</h3>
          <p><strong>Automated body scanning</strong> maps your spine, detects muscle density variations, and calibrates rollers to your exact anatomy before every session — eliminating the most common complaint with budget chairs: missing the right zones.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

