      </div>
      <div class="plstn__faq-cols">
        <div>
          <div class="plstn__faq-item" id="plstn-faq-1">
            <div class="plstn__faq-q"><h3>Are massage chairs worth it?</h3><svg class="plstn__faq-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div>
            <div class="plstn__faq-body"><p>A premium massage chair pays for itself over 12&ndash;18 months compared to regular massage therapy. Our customers consistently report better sleep, reduced back pain, and improved daily wellness. The math is simple. The feeling is even more compelling.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="plstn__faq-item" id="plstn-faq-2">
            <div class="plstn__faq-q"><h3>What is the best massage chair?</h3><svg class="plstn__faq-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div>
            <div class="plstn__faq-body"><p>It depends on your body, health goals, and budget. OHCO is ideal for design-forward buyers. Panasonic excels in therapeutic precision. Positive Posture is perfect for daily comfort. Koyo offers exceptional value. D.Core leads in innovation. Visit us &mdash; we&rsquo;ll match you in under 30 minutes.</p></div>
